{%- doc -%}
  Judge.me crops product photos into squares (e.g. in the "How would you rate this product?"
  popup), cutting off the child's head and feet. Shows the full photo instead. Only targets
  store product images, so reviewer avatars and uploaded review photos keep Judge.me's styling.
{%- enddoc -%}

<style>
  [class*='jdgm'] img[src*='/cdn/shop/'],
  [class*='jdgm'] img[src*='cdn.shopify.com/s/files/'] {
    object-fit: contain !important;
  }

  /* The product page already spaces sections; drop Judge.me's extra margin above the reviews. */
  .jdgm-rev-widg {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
</style>
